# Not `dist`. It is a build output and Vite's scaffold ignores it, which is
# right for a site that gets deployed and wrong here: this bundle is compiled
# into the cupel binary, so it has to be in the repository for `cargo build` to
# work at all. CI rebuilds it from source and fails on any difference.

